n criteria",{"children":"Programme and selection criteria"}],["$","li","Draft goals or essays",{"children":"Draft goals or essays"}],["$","li","Projects completed together",{"children":"Projects completed together"}],["$","li","Exact deadline and portal instructions",{"children":"Exact deadline and portal instructions"}]]}]]}],["$","section","Help without writing the letter",{"id":"section-3","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Help without writing the letter"}],[["$","p","A concise evidence sheet is appropriate. It reminds the referee of outcomes, dates and examples. Do not pressure a referee to sign a letter they did not write or cannot support.",{"children":"A concise evidence sheet is appropriate. It reminds the referee of outcomes, dates and examples. Do not pressure a referee to sign a letter they did not write or cannot support."}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","section","Manage the submission respectfully",{"id":"section-4","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Manage the submission respectfully"}],[["$","p","Send one polite reminder before the deadline, confirm receipt if the portal allows it and thank the referee. Keep them updated on the outcome.",{"children":"Send one polite reminder before the deadline, confirm receipt if the portal allows it and thank the referee. Keep them updated on the outcome."}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","section","Match referees to different criteria",{"id":"section-5","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Match referees to different criteria"}],[["$","p","When two letters are required, choose referees who add complementary evidence. One might assess academic or research readiness while another explains leadership, professional judgement or public-service impact.",{"children":"When two letters are required, choose referees who add complementary evidence. One might assess academic or research readiness while another explains leadership, professional judgement or public-service impact."}]],"$undefined"]}],"$L17","$L18"]]}],null,"$L19"]